    {
      "filename": "嘉義笨港水仙宮.jpg",
      "title": "File:嘉義笨港水仙宮.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E7%AC%A8%E6%B8%AF%E6%B0%B4%E4%BB%99%E5%AE%AE.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%98%89%E7%BE%A9%E7%AC%A8%E6%B8%AF%E6%B0%B4%E4%BB%99%E5%AE%AE.jpg",
      "width": 16266,
      "height": 5417,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0",
      "artist": "Chiang HueiChin",
      "description": "​水仙宮是乾隆四年（1739年）建,乾隆四十五年（1780年）笨港貢生林開周鳩資購材拓建, 2018年嘉義縣政名登記為嘉義縣文化資產古物, 此廟的石爐「綬帶耳雲龍紋方形石爐」著稱.   其白色山牆為台灣廟宇罕見.",
      "dateCreated": "2023-09-18 10:00:48",
